      'SECTION 6 · APPLICATION — IN PRACTICE\nApplication — Behavioural Strategy in Practice\nTime: 40–55 minutes including simulation debrief and assessment (Distortion Lab: 20–25 min · 6.1: 15–18 min · then Unit Summary).',
